Subject: Widen GitLab 18 Gemfile constraints for security lockfile bumps

Origin: DHI-internal (GitLab 18 constraint widenings)
CVE: CVE-2026-33635
CVE: CVE-2025-67202
CVE: CVE-2026-63435
Description: Relax Gemfile pins so bundle lock can resolve mail 2.9.1, sidekiq-cron 2.4.0, sys-filesystem 1.5, and icalendar 2.12.x without upstream version guard failures. Updates the sidekiq-cron poller patch guard for 2.4.0. icalendar, sidekiq-cron, and mail are the CVE widenings; sys-filesystem 1.5 is a musl constraint.
Base-Tree: git https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-foss.git c2489ed0b243dbe48018e13dea8df3ac2652c8b1
Adaptation: Constraint-only edits; lockfile bumps run in the package build pipeline.
Verify: cmd `git apply --check -p1` expect exit 0
Forwarded: not-needed (security rebuild on published GitLab 18 line)
Drop-When: never: widenings track the maintained GitLab 18.x line in this package

diff --git a/Gemfile b/Gemfile
